  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"./assets/readme/accounts-demo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"DeepSeek Harness OpenAI Codex settings showing four pooled accounts, weekly usage, account controls, and privacy settings\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "OpenAI Codex Plugin for the DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "Lets you manage your pool of OpenAI subscriptions in DSH."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Multi-account OpenAI Codex OAuth and usage controls\n- Web search and image generation\n- Chinese UI follows the language selected in DSH\n- Model identity and routing guidance for agents\n- The official OpenAI Docs skill, vendored from\n  [openai/skills](https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/openai-docs)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "The plugin adds a durable runtime-context snapshot that tells an agent its\nactive provider/model, the models advertised by the `openai-codex` adapter,\nwhat Sol, Terra, and Luna are for, and which orchestration tools accept an\nexplicit model. DSH writes this snapshot at session start and replaces it only\nwhen the active model or advertised catalogue changes; it is not repeated on\nevery request."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install the DeepSeek Harness Codex plugin",
      "text": "Add it to your DSH Web profile:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Eve-146T/DSH-CODEX-SUBSCRIPTION-POOL\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tutorial",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "install the plugin",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:Eve-146T/DSH-CODEX-SUBSCRIPTION-POOL"
    },
    {
      "section": "restart dsh",
      "text": "dsh --profile web\n```\n\nThen:\n\n1. Open Settings\n2. Click OpenAI Codex in the sidebar and login\n3. Choose OpenAI Codex as the provider in the Models tab\n\nThe optional model filter recognizes GPT-6 and Astra rollout entries while\nkeeping the current model selection unchanged."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm run build\npnpm test\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./openai-codex-auth"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "This project is distributed under [GPL-3.0-only](./LICENSE).\nThe vendored OpenAI Docs skill retains its upstream\n[license](./skills/openai-docs/LICENSE.txt)."
    }
  ],
